  "同步插件": "Sync plugins",
  "同步后的 plugin 内的 Skills、Commands、Hooks 和 MCP 会在远端环境中加载或执行。Marketplace 插件会在远端重新安装，需要远端能访问对应 marketplace source。": "Synced plugins can load or run Skills, Commands, Hooks, and MCP servers in the remote environment. Marketplace plugins are reinstalled on the remote target and require remote access to their marketplace source.",
  "同步会把本地用户级 MCP 服务器配置复制到远程主机。HTTP MCP 的 URL 会复制，文件系统 MCP 的路径会按所选远程工作区改写，但不能保证所有依赖数据和系统环境都可用。若因远程系统环境、权限或依赖缺失导致 MCP 服务器不可用，请在远程服务器上手动安装或补齐依赖。": "Sync copies local user MCP server configuration to the remote host. HTTP MCP URLs are copied, and filesystem MCP paths are rewritten for the selected remote workspace, but not all dependent data and system environment capabilities can be guaranteed. If an MCP server is unavailable because of the remote environment, permissions, or missing dependencies, install it or add the dependencies on the remote server.",
  "同步会迁移本地用户级 Skills 到远程主机，但不能保证所有依赖数据和系统环境都可用。若因远程系统环境、权限或依赖缺失导致 Skill 不可用，请在远程服务器上手动安装或补齐依赖。": "Sync migrates local user-level Skills to the remote host, but not all dependent data and system environment capabilities can be guaranteed. If a Skill is unavailable because of the remote environment, permissions, or missing dependencies, install it or add the dependencies on the remote server.",
